:0;--drift:6.7849978543818px;animation-delay:0.09795032627880573s;animation-duration:16.850853306241333s\"></span><span class=\"gold-drift absolute rounded-full bg-[#f0d091]\" style=\"left:22.94008347671479%;top:57.08388186758384%;width:2.7940928474999964px;height:2.7940928474999964px;opacity:0;--drift:-21.986390601843596px;animation-delay:5.486788395792246s;animation-duration:25.428902436047792s\"></span><span class=\"gold-drift absolute rounded-full bg-[#f0d091]\" style=\"left:27.768758730962873%;top:38.3873928594403%;width:2.332016722066328px;height:2.332016722066328px;opacity:0;--drift:16.01114620640874px;animation-delay:2.9572225720621645s;animation-duration:18.945778301917017s\"></span><span class=\"gold-drift absolute rounded-full bg-[#f0d091]\" style=\"left:21.99268713593483%;top:50.38678813492879%;width:3.165559275308624px;height:3.165559275308624px;opacity:0;--drift:10.131019938737154px;animation-delay:8.769673741888255s;animation-duration:21.41294579114765s\"></span><span class=\"gold-drift absolute rounded-full bg-[#f0d091]\" style=\"left:55.532600241713226%;top:76.69477199669927%;width:2.41783211636357px;height:2.41783211636357px;opacity:0;--drift:-16.676313657313585px;animation-delay:0.07687760703265667s;animation-duration:17.033961817622185s\"></span><span class=\"gold-drift absolute rounded-full bg-[#f0d091]\" style=\"left:19.98697982635349%;top:37.952821482904255%;width:2.2633938265498728px;height:2.2633938265498728px;opacity:0;--drift:-3.162191491574049px;animation-delay:4.334970725700259s;animation-duration:15.955009669065475s\"></span><div class=\"cosmos-vignette absolute inset-0\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-dvh max-w-3xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 sm:py-20\"><a class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-2.5 font-sans text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/75 transition hover:border-[#e9c67c] hover:text-[#f6e3b2] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#e9c67c]\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span><span>Return to Vanka&#x27;s Universe</span></a><header class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#e9c67c]/45 bg-[#0b1226]/70 px-4 py-1.5 font-sans text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#f6e3b2] backdrop-blur-md\">Being prepared</span><p class=\"font-sans text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.45em] text-[#e9c67c]\">Chapter Two</p><h1 class=\"text-shadow-lg font-display text-4xl text-[#f6e3b2] sm:text-5xl\">Memory Archive</h1><p class=\"font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75\">The place where our memories will one day live together — photos, notes, milestones, and everything worth remembering.</p></header><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\"><section class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-[#f6e3b2] sm:text-3xl\">What this archive will hold</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><li class=\"backdrop-blur-glass flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg text-[#e9c67c]\">01</span><p class=\"font-serif leading-relaxed text-white/75\">Photos and moments from every chapter of your life.</p></li><li class=\"backdrop-blur-glass flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg text-[#e9c67c]\">02</span><p class=\"font-serif leading-relaxed text-white/75\">Notes and letters written on the days that mattered.</p></li><li class=\"backdrop-blur-glass flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg text-[#e9c67c]\">03</span><p class=\"font-serif leading-relaxed text-white/75\">Milestones marked like constellations in your personal sky.</p></li></ul></section><section class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-[#f6e3b2] sm:text-3xl\">Honest status</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75 sm:text-base\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7ee0a3]\"></span><span>This informative placeholder page<!-- --> —<!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#7ee0a3]\">Live</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#e9c67c]\"></span><span>Browsing and writing memories<!-- --> —<!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#f6e3b2]\">Not implemented</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#e9c67c]\"></span><span>Uploads and permanent storage<!-- --> —<!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#f6e3b2]\">Not implemented</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#e9c67c]\"></span><span>Archive security and private access<!-- --> —<!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#f6e3b2]\">Not implemented</span></span></li></ul><div class=\"rounded-r-xl border-l-2 border-[#e9c67c] bg-[#e9c67c]/10 p-6\"><p class=\"font-serif leading-relaxed text-white/80\">Nothing is stored today. There is no upload flow, no database, and no security layer behind this page — no personal photos of Vanka are used anywhere in this project yet. These features arrive in a later phase, and this page will say so plainly until then.</p></div></section></div><nav class=\"mt-auto flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 font-sans text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-white/75 transition hover:border-[#e9c67c] hover:text-[#f6e3b2] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#e9c67c]\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span>Back to the Universe</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7e6bb] to-[#d8ab5e] px-6 py-3 font-sans text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#20160a] transition duration-300 hover:brightness-110 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#f6e3b2]\" href=\"/birthday-experience\">Birthday Experience<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></nav></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/0om590q-tq0l9.js\",\"static/chunks/3srfjz42u14tx.js\",\"static/chunks/0x1ayu0hy7e8h.js\",\"static/chunks/0el4d_rgp0j3n.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0om590q-tq0l9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42onvq6nokjl2.js\\\"\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\naf:\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"\\nb0:I[97367,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"$af\\\"]\\nb2:\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"\\nb3:I[97367,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"$b2\\\"]\\nb4:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nb6:I[68027,[\\\"$2\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2_oipcz23-bm-.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/2a65768255d6b625-s.p.3u4lli0-axodc.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/406d3fc8d5ec9f59-s.p.0mnr43et3sf34.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/cc014fcb166cf364-s.p.2cu9iw-l3ih8o.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n6:X\\n7:[[\\\"children\\\",{\\\"s\\\":\\\"__PAGE__\\\",\\\"h\\\":512,\\\"d\\\":{\\\"r\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"classNa